      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
      "name": "Whirlpool Gaze",
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "sort": 0,
      "system": {
        "_migration": {
          "previous": {
            "foundry": "13.351",
            "schema": 0.941,
            "system": "7.7.4"
          },
          "version": 0.953
        },
        "actionType": {
          "value": "action"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": 1
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Fjordcarver's condescending eyes cause a foe to feel the relentless battering of angry seas. The target takes <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\">@Damage[4d6[bludgeoning]] damage with a (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:36|basic:false] save). Regardless of their save, the target is immune to Whirlpool Gaze for 1 round.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage and has their Speeds halved for 1 round.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage, has their Speeds halved for 1 round, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage, has their Speeds halved for 1 round, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</span></p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "authors": "",
